      "text": "API\n- validates input (Zod)\n- creates job row and enqueues\n  in ONE transaction\n- reads status, cancels, retries\n- never runs a job",
      "originalText": "API\n- validates input (Zod)\n- creates job row and enqueues\n  in ONE transaction\n- reads status, cancels, retries\n- never runs a job",
